From 2c2f3d8ed661312c831433b7e9200a9764e69af1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 14:02:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Prose profile: ProseJulia, and ProseWriter 0.1-5, in Office

ProseJulia, the animated Julia-set fractal developed in the Prose
repository (prosejulia/), ships for the first time, in the Deskbar's
Office folder with the other Prose applications. ProseWriter moves to
0.1-5: the caret advances past spaces, and tracks on wrapped lines,
which were three user reports with one coordinate-space bug under them.
Both packed from the committed state of their trees.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0095-prose-profile-prosejulia-and-prosewriter-0-1-5-in-office.patch c8f1b55b87ff7199d2c71d398b6bcae30919456b549142afe5efd593e28dc8d1
